        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MPV plays more formats, like MKV, and more subtitle styles. AirPlay moves playback to Native, or sends only the sound when Native can't play it. Native switches to MPV by itself when it can't play something."
